{
  "slug": "claudecode-rexd-target",
  "name": "Claudecode Rexd Target",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Claude Code plugin for working with configured remote machines through REXD over SSH stdio. It adds target switching, remote filesystem tools, remote command execution, search, patch/edit support, and PTY sessions through a bundled MCP server. When a target is active, the plugin blocks Claude Code’s local filesystem/search/shell built-ins and directs Claude to the remote REXD tools instead.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 command**, **1 hook** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Commands** (1): `target` (Manage the active REXD target for remote Claude Code work)\n- **Hooks** (1): `PreToolUse`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `rexd-target`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install claudecode-rexd-target@claude-community` from `samiralibabic/claudecode-rexd-target`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "hook": 1,
    "command": 1,
    "mcp": 1
  },
